WEBVTT

00:00:29.287 --> 00:00:31.289
[ GRUNTING ]

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:32.769
Voldemort: HARRY.

00:00:32.812 --> 00:00:34.466
TELL ME, GRINDELWALD.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:37.078
TELL ME WHERE IT IS.

00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:38.818
GRINDELWALD.

00:00:38.862 --> 00:00:40.646
GRINDELWALD.

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:42.648
HELLO, TOM.

00:00:42.692 --> 00:00:44.868
I KNEW YOU WOULD COME
ONE DAY.

00:00:44.912 --> 00:00:49.307
BUT SURELY YOU MUST KNOW
I NO LONGER HAVE WHAT YOU SEEK.

00:00:49.351 --> 00:00:51.875
TELL ME, GRINDELWALD.
TELL ME WHERE IT IS.

00:00:51.919 --> 00:00:52.963
[ LAUGHS]

00:00:53.007 --> 00:00:54.573
TELL ME WHO POSSESSES IT.

00:00:54.617 --> 00:00:58.969
THE ELDER WAND LIES WITH HIM,
OF COURSE.

00:00:59.013 --> 00:01:02.233
BURIED IN THE EARTH.

00:01:02.277 --> 00:01:04.496
DUMBLEDORE.

00:01:05.454 --> 00:01:07.978
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:01:08.022 --> 00:01:11.808
[ PANTING ]

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:14.854
THE HALLOWS EXIST.

00:01:14.898 --> 00:01:17.857
BUT HE'S ONLY AFTER
ONE OF THEM -- THE LAST ONE.

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:19.207
HE KNOWS WHERE IT IS.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:20.599
HE'S GONNA HAVE IT
BY THE END OF THE NIGHT.

00:01:20.643 --> 00:01:22.166
YOU-KNOW-WHO'S FOUND
THE ELDER WAND.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:23.385
[ GRUNTS ]

00:01:23.428 --> 00:01:25.300
DON'T -- DON'T TOUCH HER!
UGH!

00:01:25.343 --> 00:01:28.085
LEAVE HIM!YOUR BOYFRIEND'LL GET
MUCH WORSE THAN THAT...

00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:29.347
GET OFF ME!

00:01:29.391 --> 00:01:32.698
...IF HE DOESN'T
LEARN TO BEHAVE HIMSELF.

00:01:32.742 --> 00:01:34.831
[ GRUNTING ]

00:01:34.874 --> 00:01:36.354
WHAT HAPPENED TO YOU,
UGLY?

00:01:37.616 --> 00:01:40.097
NO, NOT YOU.

00:01:40.141 --> 00:01:42.360
WHAT'S YOUR NAME?

00:01:42.404 --> 00:01:44.580
DUDLEY.
VERNON DUDLEY.

00:01:44.623 --> 00:01:45.885
CHECK IT.

00:01:47.713 --> 00:01:50.716
AND YOU, MY LOVELY?

00:01:53.328 --> 00:01:56.070
WHAT DO THEY CALL YOU?

00:01:56.113 --> 00:02:01.858
PENELOPE CLEARWATER,
HALF-BLOOD.

00:02:01.901 --> 00:02:03.207
[ HARRY GRUNTING ]

00:02:03.251 --> 00:02:04.513
[ SNIFFS ]

00:02:04.556 --> 00:02:06.602
THERE'S NO VERNON DUDLEY
ON HERE.

00:02:06.645 --> 00:02:10.780
DID YOU HEAR THAT, UGLY?
THE LIST SAYS YOU'RE LYING.

00:02:10.823 --> 00:02:13.304
HOW COME YOU DON'T WANT US
TO KNOW WHO YOU ARE?

00:02:13.348 --> 00:02:15.654
THE LIST'S WRONG.
I TOLD YOU WHO I AM.

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:20.181
[ GRUNTS ]

00:02:31.627 --> 00:02:34.891
CHANGE OF PLAN.

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:38.242
WE'RE NOT TAKING THIS LOT
TO THE MINISTRY.

00:03:17.847 --> 00:03:21.285
Bellatrix: GET DRACO.

00:03:22.417 --> 00:03:25.463
[ GRUNTING ]

00:03:25.507 --> 00:03:27.857
WELL?

00:03:30.294 --> 00:03:32.601
Draco:
I CAN'T BE SURE.

00:03:32.644 --> 00:03:36.126
DRACO, LOOK CLOSELY, SON.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:41.436
IF WE ARE THE ONES TO HAND
POTTER OVER TO THE DARK LORD,

00:03:41.479 --> 00:03:43.786
EVERYTHING
WOULD BE FORGIVEN.

00:03:43.829 --> 00:03:46.789
A-ALL WOULD BE AS IT WAS,
YOU UNDERSTAND?

00:03:46.832 --> 00:03:50.401
NOW, WE WON'T BE FORGETTING
WHO ACTUALLY CAUGHT HIM,

00:03:50.445 --> 00:03:51.968
I HOPE, MR. MALFOY.

00:03:52.011 --> 00:03:54.101
YOU DARE TO TALK TO ME LIKE THAT
IN MY OWN HOUSE?!

00:03:54.144 --> 00:03:55.363
LUCIUS!

00:03:58.496 --> 00:03:59.845
DON'T BE SHY, SWEETIE.

00:03:59.889 --> 00:04:02.283
COME OVER.

00:04:02.326 --> 00:04:05.938
NOW, IF THIS ISN'T
WHO WE THINK IT IS, DRACO,

00:04:05.982 --> 00:04:08.898
AND WE CALL HIM,
HE'LL KILL US ALL.

00:04:08.941 --> 00:04:11.683
WE NEED TO BE
ABSOLUTELY SURE.

00:04:11.727 --> 00:04:13.163
WHAT'S WRONG WITH HIS FACE?

00:04:13.207 --> 00:04:14.817
YES, WHAT IS WRONG
WITH HIS FACE?

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.253
Scabior:
HE CAME TO US LIKE THAT.

00:04:16.297 --> 00:04:18.734
SOMETHING HE PICKED UP
IN THE FOREST, I RECKON.

00:04:18.777 --> 00:04:20.866
OR RAN
INTO A STINGING JINX.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:22.390
WAS IT YOU, DEARIE?

00:04:27.395 --> 00:04:28.657
GIVE ME HER WAND.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.267
WE'LL SEE WHAT
HER LAST SPELL WAS.

00:04:31.225 --> 00:04:33.444
AH.
GOT YOU.

00:04:33.488 --> 00:04:35.098
[ LAUGHS ]

00:04:35.142 --> 00:04:36.534
[ GASPS ]

00:04:36.578 --> 00:04:39.233
WHAT IS THAT?

00:04:40.886 --> 00:04:42.497
WHERE'D YOU GET THAT FROM?

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:45.064
IT WAS IN HER BAG
WHEN WE SEARCHED HER.

00:04:45.108 --> 00:04:46.457
RECKON IT'S MINE NOW.

00:04:50.113 --> 00:04:51.506
ARE YOU MAD?!

00:04:56.641 --> 00:04:59.557
[ GRUNTING ]

00:04:59.601 --> 00:05:01.516
GO!
GET OUT!

00:05:07.652 --> 00:05:09.306
CISSY...

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:12.527
PUT THE BOYS IN THE CELLAR!

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:15.530
I WANT TO HAVE A LITTLE
CONVERSATION WITH THIS ONE.

00:05:15.573 --> 00:05:18.228
GIRL TO GIRL!

00:05:26.584 --> 00:05:27.977
WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO?

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:29.979
WE CAN'T LEAVE HERMIONE ALONE
WITH HER.

00:05:30.022 --> 00:05:32.938
Luna: RON?

00:05:36.464 --> 00:05:38.814
HARRY?

00:05:43.558 --> 00:05:46.256
LUNA?

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.303
THAT SWORD IS MEANT TO BE
IN MY VAULT AT GRINGOTTS.

00:05:49.346 --> 00:05:50.565
HOW DID YOU GET IT?

00:05:50.608 --> 00:05:52.131
[ CRYING ]

00:05:52.175 --> 00:05:54.090
WHAT ELSE DID YOU AND YOUR
FRIENDS TAKE FROM MY VAULT?!

00:05:54.133 --> 00:05:57.311
I DIDN'T TAKE ANYTHING.
PLEASE.

00:05:57.354 --> 00:05:59.400
I DIDN'T TAKE ANYTHING!

00:05:59.443 --> 00:06:01.619
I DON'T BELIEVE IT.

00:06:01.663 --> 00:06:03.926
[ SCREAMING ]

00:06:06.537 --> 00:06:08.017
WE HAVE TO DO SOMETHING.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.584
Ollivander: NO,
THERE'S NO WAY OUT OF HERE.

00:06:09.627 --> 00:06:11.977
WE'VE TRIED EVERYTHING!
IT'S ENCHANTED.

00:06:12.021 --> 00:06:13.370
Hermione:
PLEASE, PLEASE!

00:06:13.414 --> 00:06:14.676
Bellatrix: SHUT UP!

00:06:14.719 --> 00:06:16.852
YOU'RE BLEEDING, HARRY.

00:06:16.895 --> 00:06:19.028
THAT'S A CURIOUS THING
TO KEEP IN YOUR SOCK.

00:06:19.071 --> 00:06:22.031
[ HERMIONE SCREAMING ]

00:06:28.037 --> 00:06:29.343
HELP US.

00:06:35.087 --> 00:06:37.046
LET HER GO.SHUT UP. GET BACK.

00:06:38.308 --> 00:06:40.005
YOU.
GOBLIN.

00:06:40.049 --> 00:06:42.486
COME WITH ME.

